                                "sense_id": "98ef46a5-adb2-3036-9a66-f50c4357b643",
                                "text": "\"Do be quiet, will you, or I shall miss it all,\" cried Jabez, tetchily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbf0abf5-713c-42e4-998b-21d8349e52b6",
                                "sense_id": "98ef46a5-adb2-3036-9a66-f50c4357b643",
                                "text": "\"No, indeed. He got me dis little buggy—\"\n\"Sidecar,\" corrected Ryan tetchily. \"It's called a sidecar.\""
                            }
